  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "第一人称砍杀融合动作RPG深度与roguelite复玩",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Daimon Blades is a brutal first person slasher that combines the depth of action RPGs and replayability of roguelites. Launch expeditions solo or up to 4 players, and survive the many horrors of the Daimon Realm.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1869500/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "活体魔刃每局饮血进化，也会永久强化并腐化持有者",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Your Daimon weapon feeds on the blood of your enemies and will ascend during each run, unlocking more power and abilities. Its raw power can also be permanently increased in between runs allowing you to survive longer and to obliterate everything in your path. But be careful. They are more than mere tools of destruction and their corruptive nature should never be underestimated.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1869500/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "回到《E.Y.E》两千年前，追溯战僧教团的黑暗起源",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "Taking place two millenias before the events of E.Y.E: Divine Cybermancy, Daimon Blades is a dark fantasy prelude that shines a light in the obscure genesis of the Secreta order. Before guilt, there was corruption. Arising from brutality, blood, and sacrifice.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1869500/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
